        //2) What happens when you pass an object to a print or println method?
        // The object is converted into a tostring method to display it.
        
        //3) What is the scope of a variable in a method? In a class?
        //A variable inside a method is used locally within that method, and the variable in a class is global to the entire code
        
        //Create the base car as a template for the other cars.
        Car testCar = new Car();

        System.out.println("Base Car:");
        System.out.println(testCar);

        //Write the facts about other cars and addign them to a variable
        Car vwBug = new Car("VW Bug", 60, 85.0, 25000.00);
